B.a9X=new A.zO("assets/images/chariot.jpg","Katha Upanishad \xb7 1.3.3","You are the rider,\nnot the chariot.","The body is the chariot. The senses are the horses. The mind is the reins. The intellect is the charioteer. And you \u2014 the Self \u2014 are the one riding.","When the charioteer sleeps, the horses choose the road.")
B.a9W=new A.zO("assets/images/road.jpg","Harvard \xb7 Science, 2010","Half of life is lived\non autopilot.","Researchers pinged 2,250 people at random moments. 46.9% of the time their minds were somewhere else \u2014 and they were less happy when their minds wandered.","The autopilot can't be seen from inside the autopilot. Something has to knock.")
B.a9Y=new A.zO("assets/images/witness.jpg","Sakshi \xb7 the witness","This app is a voice\nthat knocks.","At random moments it will ask, by name: Who is driving? Where were you? What are you feeling? You answer in ten seconds. Over the days, it draws a map of your inner world.","The goal is that one day you won't need it \u2014 the voice will be yours.")
